{"id":1529,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为深入贯彻落实高校毕业生就业工作部署，进一步深化校企合作，拓宽毕业生就业渠道，6 月 3 日下午，艺术学院党委书记郭云霞、党委副书记刘晓玲、学生科科长夏志丽带领 2 名本科生一行，前往瀚蓝音乐、成都知行启智科技有限公司、大叁未来艺术三家企业开展访企拓岗专项行动。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUmLLbLRNsM8rkoMz7PLzC8LmL8UzvoYM46RMR9DUzlbLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVU1hVU1yZMlQkLRQRLln7ozC8MNUbMR9bnmVRoR-DU8MFMmV7oRlsUmnFLz-bU47Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aMmG0Lzv8ozlJqdunx&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0EBEB85FB06C1DD9646D9489F1C826CC/61D857B4/129C1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gLlCLPLRVVo7nVUM4MkMNUaUm-PnmAo2oz7YnzGsM8rkM4L0gihFp2hmCIa0LSysLSyiMkyDMzl8oRUin7M2LlMRLRA7M8-snRlsM4QVU4WFnmvPL8-bnmfFMNUiM7CJqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aMmG0Lzv8ozlJqdunx&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gnmNLDUN-ZLNnRnMRfRnzvPoRU4MlQo7LzLaoR-DMz9Pozl0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPn1hRoSy4oz9YnllZLNr2L8LbMN7YnR94MRNsUN-8UlQFnmLbU47ZLNrFnzn2L1b/v2veo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGDLkyPM4UbMSbw62u8c&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/61FC93982EE82EF3C96A2D83497BB4AF/F39C182E/E4F2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gM4ML2nzlsMRf2oMz94UmGiMmv8L4voZnNQ7MmNPMl74M7L0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hVn1yDUYhRn7W2ozUbMl-bLlCYUN-4Mm-DLzQ2UmWRolVFozlYM8rkLmWFMmLsLlU8gtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLRCag47sMRNigtA8pUucc&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUmGL8L4rfnlLaMMmvDMz67U8liMRloDLm67LlVfMzf2MRv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPMYysoSyZn7V2LNQVol-8MmGaLml8U8lbMl7DUzr7MRAFMzvYoR-4LR6FLznVU47Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aMmG0Lzv8ozlJqdunx&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D17798DAF2FE9B4600254CE95A6A5D48/57282307/14EC1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gMRLLiMR6fMRU4LMzlYolQVoRG4M4Uo8UNC8Lm6VnlQRMmC0gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2UYybnkyYnl-ZLNL4UzlPU4W7U4A2MRG8LzLYLNLYMzWFUzL8MRWVnNrFM8C8n77Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aMmG0Lzv8ozlJqdunx&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次走访调研旨在加强学院与企业的沟通交流，了解行业发展趋势和人才需求，为毕业生搭建更优质的就业平台。在走访过程中，郭云霞书记一行与各企业负责人进行了深入座谈。座谈会上，郭云霞书记介绍了学院的专业设置、人才培养模式以及毕业生情况，表达了希望与企业在人才培养、实习就业、产学研合作等方面开展深度合作的意愿。各企业负责人对艺术学院一行的到来表示热烈欢迎，并详细介绍了企业的发展历程、业务范围、企业文化、人才需求等情况。他们对学院的人才培养质量给予了高度评价，表达了与学院建立长期稳定合作关系的愿望。<br /></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gM4lL4L4LaMlV2UMm94MlnfL4-bLR6okoR7ZMmQkoz-ZnmL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkMYh7okyZLRV7oRMfLzGiolQ7U8MfL4linl-bn7n2U8nFL8lsolLiU8WFnlCZLkb/v2veo4OeptrsC5W8gDTJQty0LmGDLkyPM4UbMSbw62u8c&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CB7D8801D83A1059FDCCA355EB9DDFCD/3E79C5CB/EF80\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gM8MLfUlLanzn7MMR78L8-inNUsLNUoYMz7Ynl-sLzffU870gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkoShRLkyaL7n7U4lYnlrVnNV7nz-4M7MkUzLDLlUPUlVFM7nVozVfnmfFMRNaMRGZgtXaQ4Oeo4xJQ56AvjU0qIbtpYyYLRCag47sMRNigtA8pUucc&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg\"></p><p>在交流过程中，随行的2 名本科生与企业工作人员进行了互动交流及现场面试，了解了企业的工作环境、职业发展路径等情况，达成了初步就业意向。此次访企拓岗活动，不仅加强了艺术学院与企业之间的联系与合作，为毕业生开拓了更多的就业岗位和机会，也为学院进一步优化人才培养方案、提高人才培养质量提供了有益的参考。</p><p>未来，艺术学院将继续深入开展访企拓岗专项行动，不断拓展校企合作的广度和深度，为毕业生高质量就业和学院事业发展奠定坚实基础。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 一审:夏志丽</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 二审：刘晓玲</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://art.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=gUmLLbLRNsM8rkoMz7PLzC8LmL8UzvoYM46RMR9DUzlbLzl0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhVU1hVU1yZMlQkLRQRLln7ozC8MNUbMR9bnmVRoR-DU8MFMmV7oRlsUmnFLz-bU47Jqjfjo4OeoDbT6DVY6khXptQ0g4-aMmG0Lzv8ozlJqdunx&oid=2004969448&tid=2060&nid=17495&e=.jpg"}